# Deliberately kept out of this public repo.
#
# KICKOFF.md names the kids. calendar-backend.gs holds their names and the
# venues they train at in its config block. Neither is needed for GitHub Pages
# to serve the app -- Pages only needs index.html, the manifest, the service
# worker and the icons.
#
# The backend still lives in Apps Script, which keeps its own version history,
# so taking it out of git here does not lose the ability to roll it back.
KICKOFF.md
calendar-backend.gs
.claude/
